        <mxCell id="bDREWnKEDmdqimSspBDH-51" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;New packet&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;1.1. Sniffer sends the packet over kafka topic to analyzer&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;1.2. Analyzer gets the packet from topic&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;1.3. Analyzer checks all the filters and adds new packet and tags to database&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;1.4. Analyzer sends id of new packet to kafka&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;1.5 Backend gets new packet id&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;1.6 Backend sends new packet id to frontend by websocket&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="639" width="220" height="321" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
